OL,3,GNEWSASurprise visit for village with
OL,4,Abus stop but no buses
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a village that saw a new
OL,7,Fbus stop installed - despite having no
OL,8,Fbus service - have been paid a surprise
OL,9,Fvisit by enthusiasts.
OL,11,FPeople in Egginton, Derbyshire, said
OL,12,Fthey felt cut off after the last hourly
OL,13,FV2 Villager served the village in 2017,
OL,14,Fforcing people to travel in cars or
OL,15,Ftaxis to access services in nearby
OL,16,Ftowns and villages.
OL,18,FFor the first time in almost a decade,
OL,19,Fthe village saw a bus visit on Sunday
OL,20,Fafter vintage transport enthusiasts
OL,21,Fbrought their 1964 Daimler bus and
OL,22,Fparked it at the new, yet unused, stop.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
